				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				89,
				3
			],
			"Message": "chore(Project): Synchronize submodules and enhance cross-platform infrastructure\n\nThis commit updates critical submodules and refines Land's cross-platform architecture:\n\n1. **Mountain** gains comprehensive Apple platform support (commit c8f303c2):\n   - Adds asset catalog with AppIcons (20x20 to 1024x1024) compliant with Apple HIG\n   - Introduces Xcode project with Metal framework integration for iOS/macOS targets\n   - Implements Podfile setup and LaunchScreen storyboard for native Tauri iOS targets\n   Maintains strict separation between Mountain's native backend and Wind/Sky's declarative UI layer.\n\n2. **SideCar** cleanup removes accidental .DS_Store files (commit c8f303c2) from runtime directories (aarch64-apple-darwin, x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu), improving repository hygiene without affecting runtime behavior.\n\n3. **Dependency Updates** across submodules (commit 5d169cda):\n   - Upgrades Effect-TS ecosystem packages (@effect/*) in Cocoon, Wind, and Common\n   - Modernizes GitHub Actions dependencies (actions/checkout 4.2.2→5.0.0)\n   - Updates Node.js type definitions (@types/node 24.2.0→24.2.1)\n   - Enhances SideCar with Node.js v24.5.0/v22.18.0 binaries for cross-platform support\n\n4. **Debug.sh** receives a minor update with an additional newline for script consistency.\n\nAll changes align with Land's architectural principles of resource efficiency, strict separation between native backend (Mountain) and runtime dependencies, and declarative effects-based architecture. No breaking changes introduced.\n\nRefs #106 #186 #344 #346 #320 #161",
			"SHA": "0a6646fecbbb7e2a514f4ead0e68557ec80e2265"
		},
